        "valueString": "No chest pain or shortness of breath at rest. Mild exertional shortness of breath on hills, unchanged from last year. No paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea. Sleeps with one pillow; no orthopnoea reported. No increase in oedema; weight stable by report."
      }
